# Product Policy Baseline

## Profile and Claim Rules

- Student profile creation is profile-only (no immediate user account creation).
- Alumni: `firstName`, `lastName`, `graduationYear` required; emails optional.
- Student: `firstName`, `lastName`, `schoolEmail` required; `personalEmail` optional.
- Alumni self-edit should not allow `graduationYear` changes.

## Mentorship Rules

- Communication/scheduling is contact-based (outside in-app chat/scheduling).
- If alumni is open to mentorship, at least one contact method should exist.
- Do not allow duplicate active mentorship requests for same studentâ†’alumni pair.

## Access and Privacy

- Resume visibility: students/faculty/admin can view alumni resumes; alumni cannot view other alumni resumes.
- Keep announcement/event targeting consistent with role visibility rules.
